  aciklama:
  - "Fincan g\xF6rsellerinin bir noktas\u0131nda g\xF6z\xFCme direkt sen \xE7arpt\u0131n.
    \xC7evrende ise telvelerden ar\u0131nm\u0131\u015F geni\u015F bir bo\u015Fluk
    g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Maddi a\xE7\u0131dan s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131l\u0131 g\xFCnler
    ge\xE7irmi\u015F, ailen ve \xE7evren taraf\u0131ndan yaln\u0131z b\u0131rak\u0131lm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n
    {{isim}}. D\xFCzenli bir gelirinin olmas\u0131, gider dengeni kurmanda sana yeteri
    kadar yard\u0131mc\u0131 olmam\u0131\u015F. Gururlu bir insan oldu\u011Funu ve
    kimseden yard\u0131m istememeye \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    da d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCnce, bu bo\u015Flu\u011Fu ve \xE7ekilen zorlu\u011Fu daha
    iyi anl\u0131yorum. Telvelerin, zorlu g\xFCnlerinin {{mevsim_+1}} mevsimiyle
    birlikte geride kalmaya ba\u015Flayaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 f\u0131s\u0131ld\u0131yor. "
